```php
class Heavy
{
    public int $v = 0;
}
$r = new ReflectionClass(Heavy::class);
$o = $r->newLazyGhost(function (Heavy $obj) {
    $obj->v = 21;
});
echo $r->isUninitializedLazyObject($o) ? 'yes' : 'no';
$o->v;
echo $r->isUninitializedLazyObject($o) ? 'yes' : 'no';
```

Answer with the result (a number, a string, or yes/no).

turns.answer_raw:
{
  "answer": "yesno",
  "explanation": "Reading a property on an uninitialized lazy ghost triggers its initializer, so the second check is no."
}

